{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747070/extras/7bed016d631dd0c38f62edfb709a993a.avif?t=1760999962\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747070/extras_big/7bed016d631dd0c38f62edfb709a993a.avif?t=1760999962 width=800 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravitee is the platformer with a twist! Rotate your character in order to change the direction of gravity. Navigate your way through each level in order to reach the goal. Solve puzzles, face off against deadly spikes and bombs, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747070/extras/c45b344ad1c05d82b893672e19683f9b.poster.avif?t=1760999962\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747070/extras/c45b344ad1c05d82b893672e19683f9b.webm?t=1760999962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747070/extras/c45b344ad1c05d82b893672e19683f9b.mp4?t=1760999962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contains:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 fun and unique levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ different types of obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ golden marbles to collect as optional challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unlockable costumes for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 achievements</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/ima